    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36114" root="قلخ" body-key="q">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَخَ</span></b> , (S, L, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَخَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْخٌ</span> (S,
K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُلَاخٌ</span> (L) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلِيخٌ</span>, (Sb, S, K,) <i>He</i> (a
stallion-camel) <i>brayed:</i> (S, L, K:) or <i>began to
bray:</i> or <i>brayed vehemently, as though he pulled
out the sound from his chest.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَخَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّجَرَةَ</span> <i>He pulled out,</i> or <i>up, the tree:</i> (K, TA:)
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span> being substituted for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ع</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَخَ</span> <i>He struck a dry thing upon,</i> or <i>against, a
dry thing.</i> (K.)

